ther fashionable to say  that um we don't know what labour stands  for and i i want to give credit where  credit is due because on thursday you  yourself made a very clear statement uh  which you said we are not going into the  next election saying that we will enter  the single market uh or the eu  now um six years ago you said we can  stop this madness bring this nightmare  to an end through a vote in parliament  actually exactly the opposite um  it's perfectly right for uh acceptable  for anybody in politics to change their  mind but i wonder if you could explain  when you changed your mind on this and  why  well look thank you very trevor for uh  saying that i've been absolutely clear  we are not going into the next general  election promising to rejoin the single  market or go into the eu uh the position  is settled you know that i took a very  strong position  i was not for brexit i was what would be  described as remainer but quite a lot's  happened  in those six years we've had two general  elections we had the referendum  in the first place and actually we've  also got the withdrawal agreement we  stepped out of the european union and  i'm afraid the definition of madness is  doing the same thing over and over again  the british people have made that  decision it has now been determined uh  and  there are things that we can do of  course and i've talked about financial  uh equivalency for example we need a  veterinary deal with the european union  i i want to have an association with  horizon so our science doesn't lose out  in this country so there's a lot we can  do but we're not now rehashing the  debate that we had for the previous six  years well that's that's clear that that  one's over this very very quickly if i  may ask you will labour agree with the  prime minister that it's time to import  tariffs on steel imports to protect our  steel industry and the jobs they're in  i i saw this uh emerging news  i believe in free trade it's good for  everyone tariffs is usually a bad idea i  i've only just heard this news i'd want  to get into the detail but my instinct  is this can't be right  david lemmy thank you very much indeed  thank you

